    <p class="govuk-!-margin-bottom-2">
      On 15 January 2026, Tabitha Quibble selected and concealed five items of clothing worth £247.50 at Selfridges without paying. She was apprehended by police within 15 minutes and all items were recovered.
    </p>
      <p class="govuk-body-s govuk-!-margin-top-2 govuk-!-margin-bottom-0">
