      <div id="overview-expanded-quibble" hidden>
        <p class="govuk-body govuk-!-margin-top-3">At approximately 14:20, Quibble entered Selfridges with co-defendant Percival Snodgrass. Over the following six minutes, she selected five items of clothing worth £247.50 and concealed them in her personal bag while Snodgrass acted as lookout.</p>
        <p class="govuk-body">At approximately 14:28, both defendants moved toward the exit. Security guard M. Bumble moved to intercept them; Snodgrass assaulted Bumble during flight. Quibble was present but did not participate in the assault.</p>
        <p class="govuk-body">Both defendants were apprehended by police within 15 minutes. All stolen items were recovered in good condition.</p>

